# Brand-kit masters: ~1.2 MB of SVG/PNG logo, symbol, app-icon, and
# reference-sheet artwork plus the kit's own docs. Design source, never read
# at runtime -- the only brand files the container actually serves are the
# favicon/manifest/logo copies under apps/web/public/, which the Dockerfile's
# `pnpm --filter @sift/web build` emits into apps/web/dist. Excluded so
# `COPY . .` does not carry the masters into the image.
docs/brand

# Local SQLite + Strands session data (~700 MB). Never baked into an image.
.sift-data
